  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers 5 and 8 :\n\nOption 1) 5 × 7 + 8 - 3 = 58 = 14 ⇒ 8 × 7 + 5 - 3 = 58\n\n⇒ __**8 × 7**__ + 5 - 3 = 58\n\n⇒ __**56 + 5**__ - 3 = 58\n\n⇒ 61 - 3 = 58\n\n⇒ 58 = 58 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) 5 + 8 × 3 - 9 = 14 ⇒ 8 + 5 × 3 - 9 = 14\n\n⇒ 8 + __**5 × 3**__ - 9 = 14\n\n⇒ __**8 + 15**__ - 9 = 14\n\n⇒ __**23 - 9**__ = 14\n\n⇒ 14 = 14 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) 8 - 5 × 2 + 6 = -3 ⇒ 5 - 8 × 2 + 6 = -3\n\n⇒ 5 - __**8 × 2**__ + 6 = -3\n\n⇒ __**5 + 6**__ - 16 = -3\n\n⇒ __**11 - 16**__ = -3\n\n**⇒ -5 ≠ -3 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 5 - 8 + 7 = 10 ⇒ 8 - 5 + 7 = 10\n\n⇒ __**8 + 7**__ - 5 = 10\n\n⇒ __**15 - 5**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 10 = 10 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
